flowchart TD
    A["Verified tasks integrated into main; record exact boundaries"] --> B{"Run auto-deploy enabled?"}
    B -->|No| C["Report integration; ask whether to deploy"]
    B -->|Yes| D{"Project pause or release-failure hold?"}
    D -->|Yes| E["Preserve pending tasks; no automatic release"]
    D -->|No| F{"Full batch or final smaller batch ready?"}
    F -->|No| G["Wait for task progress; continuous development may refill"]
    G --> F
    F -->|Yes| H["Freeze oldest completed task IDs and exact release boundary"]
    C -->|User approves reported release| H
    H --> I{"Target authority, preview gates, and artifact checks pass?"}
    I -->|No| J["Report missing gate; do not submit"]
    I -->|Yes| K["Submit one batch; record provider operation identity"]
    K --> L{"Provider and live checks pass?"}
    L -->|No or unknown| M["Hold automatic releases; inspect outcome; recover when authorized"]
    M --> N["Continue only unaffected development; require resolution evidence before retry"]
    L -->|Yes| O["Record deployed task IDs once; repair tracking without redeploying"]
    O --> P["Stop owned previews; remove eligible worktrees; verify cleanup"]
    P -->|More pending work| D
